A picture's edges painted on into a wider, taller or square canvas by Qwen-Image 2.1 with AusBoss's Outpaint v2, the picture kept pixel for pixel. The stage's key now says the lab's painters, so a stage drawn before they came is drawn again (no Letter it since 1394, no Outpaint).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
